desc:
North facing renovated 1-bedroom unit on 2nd floor with balcony – PETS ARE WELCOME!

Professionally managed by Transpacific Realty Advisors Ltd.

You’ll sleep well in this quiet, north facing, 1-bedroom suite in the Grandview-Woodlands area. The unit has been renovated to the highest standard and is nestled just steps from amenities and transit on East Broadway and Commercial Drive. Your feet will get you to all the transportation, restaurants, entertainment, nightlife and shopping needs you may have.

Features of this rental opportunity:

•	Galley kitchen with granite countertops and dishwasher;
•	Bright living room and dining room space with north facing large balcony;
•	Queen-sized bedroom with closet and mirror by-pass doors;
•	Bright 3-piece bathroom with updated plumbing and fixtures;

•	Controlled access building with secure underground parking (additional cost);
•	Pet-friendly community with dog parks and quiet neighbourhood walks;
•	Located on major bus route and only a short walk to Commercial skytrain station;
•	Well suited for car commuters as well as pedestrian, transit, bicycle and zip car users;


Rent includes heat and hot water, pet friendly pending approval. You’ll be cozy and warm this fall on the quiet side of the property in this north facing, beautifully renovated unit on bustling East Broadway, Vancouver. 

For more information or if you have any questions, please CALL Andrea at  show contact info
 and be sure to specify Penelope Apartments unit 210.

